<title>ITALY: CYCLING-SPAIN'S RUBIERA WINS 19TH GIRO STAGE.</title>
<headline>CYCLING-SPAIN'S RUBIERA WINS 19TH GIRO STAGE.</headline>
<dateline>FALZES, Italy 1997-06-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>Jose Luis Rubiera of Spain won the 222-km 19th stage of the Giro d'Italia cycle race on Thursday, according to provisional results.  </p>
<p>Italians Roberto Conti and Giuseppe Guerini were second and third, according to the provisional results.</p>
<p>Ivan Gotti of Italy retained the overall lead.</p>
